                  class="min-w-[12rem] px-3 py-2 font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100"
                  scope="col"
                >
                  GitHub Copilot (architecture ad-hoc)
                </th>
                <th
                  class="min-w-[12rem] px-3 py-2 font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100"
                  scope="col"
                >
                  ChatGPT / Claude (manual prompting)
                </th>
                <th
                  class="min-w-[12rem] px-3 py-2 font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100"
                  scope="col"
                >
                  Structurizr (+ AI assist)
                </th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr
                class="border-b border-neutral-100 odd:bg-white even:bg-neutral-50/80 dark:border-neutral-800 dark:odd:bg-neutral-950 dark:even:bg-neutral-900/40"
              >
                <th
                  class="max-w-[200px] px-3 py-3 align-top font-medium text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100"
                  scope="row"
                >
                  Pricing
                </th>
                <td
                  class="px-3 py-3 align-top text-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-200"
                >
                  Consumption-based SaaS with published packaging documentation and quote-led enterprise paths.
                </td>
                <td
                  class="px-3 py-3 align-top text-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-200"
                >
                  Typical fit: per-seat developer tooling billed for IDE assistance.
                </td>
                <td
                  class="px-3 py-3 align-top text-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-200"
                >
                  Typical fit: conversational assist with unstructured outputs and manual prompting.
                </td>
                <td
                  class="px-3 py-3 align-top text-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-200"
                >
                  Typical fit: modeling and diagram DSL with optional SaaS tiers; packaged governance evidence varies by rollout.
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr
                class="border-b border-neutral-100 odd:bg-white even:bg-neutral-50/80 dark:border-neutral-800 dark:odd:bg-neutral-950 dark:even:bg-neutral-900/40"
              >
                <th
                  class="max-w-[200px] px-3 py-3 align-top font-medium text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100"
                  scope="row"
                >
                  AI capability
                </th>
                <td
                  class="px-3 py-3 align-top text-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-200"
                >
                  Purpose-built governed review workflow — multi-agent synthesis, deterministic replay, routed models behind human-reviewed outcomes.
                </td>
                <td
                  class="px-3 py-3 align-top text-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-200"
                >
                  Typical fit: code completions and refactoring assistance in the editor.
                </td>
                <td
                  class="px-3 py-3 align-top text-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-200"
                >
                  Often used for exploratory analysis; repeatability depends on prompting and transcripts.
                </td>
                <td
                  class="px-3 py-3 align-top text-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-200"
                >
                  Typical fit: architecture modeling views; analytical depth tied to authored models and integrations.
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr
                class="border-b border-neutral-100 odd:bg-white even:bg-neutral-50/80 dark:border-neutral-800 dark:odd:bg-neutral-950 dark:even:bg-neutral-900/40"
              >
                <th
                  class="max-w-[200px] px-3 py-3 align-top font-medium text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100"
                  scope="row"
                >
                  Governance & audit posture
                </th>
                <td
                  class="px-3 py-3 align-top text-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-200"
                >
                  Committed review records, segregation-of-duty gates, typed audit envelopes, and replay/export paths aligned to architecture review packs.
                </td>
                <td
                  class="px-3 py-3 align-top text-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-200"
                >
                  Typical fit: developer workflow tooling — not an architecture-evidence catalogue product.
                </td>
                <td
                  class="px-3 py-3 align-top text-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-200"
                >
                  Typical fit: interactive Q&A — not a governed package with finalized signed review record lineage by default.
                </td>
                <td
                  class="px-3 py-3 align-top text-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-200"
                >
                  Typical fit: documenting system context — governance promotion workflows differ from packaged review records.
                </td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>
    </details>
